1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,510
Eternal winter.
For all eight billion people.

2
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,276
I brought a sled.

3
00:00:06,358 --> 00:00:10,377
This is not a snow day, Cleo.
This is DOOM.

4
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:14,476
Why is it so small?

5
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,790
Not the yard!
The PLANET!

6
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:22,310
It's a start.

7
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:24,336
Maximum doom!

8
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:27,150
Get in.

9
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:29,750
A villain does not
go sledding.

10
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:31,706
Wheeeee!

11
00:00:32,059 --> 00:00:36,525
Again! Again!
I mean... phase two.

12
00:00:36,599 --> 00:00:37,728
Sure.
